{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会in幕張メッセ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部 ふわふわ巻き\n4部 ふわふわ巻き＋三つ編み"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/07/5593660/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"森からやってきたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピース ライチ\nネックレス 自由が丘の雑貨屋さん\nカーディガン ParAvion\n靴下 ライチ\n靴 お母さんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前買ったワンピースだよー\n形がかわいいんだー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/07/5593660/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金髪生駒に\n「いつかその森を破滅してやる」\nと言われたので\n「私がいる限り森は破滅しないわ」\nと答えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は森の妖精♪とるんるんしてたら\n周りに人がいなくなりました。\nなんでえ！！！！！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/07/5593660/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は森の民じゃなくて\n森の妖精だもん♪←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部 巻きツイン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/07/5593660/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかのルームウェア。\nメンバーにびっくりされたよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルームウェア LAZY DAISY"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らしくない！！\nでも持ってるから着るしかない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段こんなに脚出さないから\n落ち着かんかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/07/5593660/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親友とおそろいなのさ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/07/5593660/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり握手楽しいな。\n元気いっぱいもらえる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/07/5593660/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/07/5593660/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"森で収穫した木の実を\nネックレスにしたんだよ☆\n紫の実がいちばん美味しいよ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}